          "font" : "AdvTT349184da",
          "font size" : 8.5,
          "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
          "content" : "Generally, nonsurgical treatment is performed for isolated grade III injuries. If combined with an ACL tear, may attempt initial nonsurgical treatment. Tibial-based MCL tears are less likely to heal without residual laxity when treated nonsurgically, and reconstruction is recommended."
        } ]
      } ]
