          "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
          "content" : "Surgical treatment with reconstruction of cruciate ligaments and reconstruction of collateral/corner injuries. Early intervention is associated with improved outcomes. Staged treatment is associated with higher failure rates."
